          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Reach & Reserve</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for upcoming sound bath events, private sessions, and collaborations in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1: #0f1724; /* deep indigo */\\n      --bg2: #071029; /* near black-blue */\\n      --accent: #8ee3d6; /* mint */\\n      --accent-2: #f6c6ff; /* soft orchid */\\n      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      --maxw: 1100px;\\n      --gutter: 28px;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      color: #e6eef6;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:48px auto;padding:24px;position:relative;}\\n\\n    /* Split diagonal layout */\\n    .stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:stretch;background:transparent;}\\n    .panel{border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);}\\n    .left{background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14,22,38,0.6), rgba(8,12,22,0.75));padding:40px 36px;position:relative;min-height:520px;}\\n    .right{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);}\\n\\n    /* Diagonal cut using pseudo element */\\n    .left:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-60px;bottom:-40px;width:260px;height:260px;background:linear-gradient(120deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%);transform:rotate(20deg);border-radius:20px;}\\n\\n    header{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#07202a}\\n    nav{margin-left:auto}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}\\n    nav a.contact{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\\n\\n    h1{margin:12px 0 6px;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    p.lead{color:rgba(230,238,246,0.85);margin:0 0 22px;line-height:1.5}\\n\\n    .tears{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9)}\\n\\n    /* Form */\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:rgba(230,238,246,0.85)}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],textarea,select,input[type=date]{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));color:inherit;font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .submit{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(140,220,200,0.12);border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .hint{font-size:13px;color:rgba(230,238,246,0.7)}\\n\\n    /* Additional info blocks */\\n    .info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .muted{color:rgba(230,238,246,0.7);font-size:14px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .pillar{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));margin-top:6px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:rgba(230,238,246,0.6);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* Pattern svg backdrop */\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14;mix-blend-mode:screen}\\n    .pattern-svg{width:100%;height:100%}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:920px){\\n      .stage{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .left{min-height:320px}\\n      .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- decorative SVG pattern (unique, embedded) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern-svg\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p0\\\" width=\\\"72\\\" height=\\\"72\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(18)\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"72\\\" height=\\\"72\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"></rect>\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 36h72\\\" stroke=\\\"#6ee0d3\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"2.8\\\" fill=\\\"#f7ccff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"2.8\\\" fill=\\\"#8ee3d6\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 72 L72 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n        </pattern>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#07202a\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#081a2b\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.03\\\"/>\\n        </linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p0)\\\"/>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"panel left\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n        <header>\\n          <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"line-height:1\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(230,238,246,0.5)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <nav aria-label=\\\"main\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"/\\\">Gather</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"/events.html\\\">Series</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"/private-sessions.html\\\">1:1</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\">Why we hold</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\" class=\\\"contact\\\">Connect</a>\\n          </nav>\\n        </header>\\n\\n        <h1 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Reach out — whisper, reserve, inquire</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">A short note to start. Tell us what you feel ready for: the public circle, a private offering, or a conversation about bringing sound to your space.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"tears\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Next event: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Venue: {{VENUE_NAME}}</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"info-grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Flow of a typical session</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">We hold a gentle arc: arrival & settling; intention & short breathwork; the immersion (instruments unfold); guided return & tea. Expect 60–90 minutes, soft lighting, and comfortable reclining.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">What to bring</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">A yoga mat, a cozy blanket, a small pillow, water, and anything that helps you relax (eye cover, socked feet). We provide bolsters and extra blankets on request.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Contraindications & safety</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Sound can shift heart rate and sensation. Please disclose pregnancy, epilepsy, recent head trauma, pacemakers, or severe unmanaged anxiety. For clinical contraindications, consult your healthcare provider before attending. Contact us for alternatives and accommodations.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <footer>\\n          <div>Prefer to call? <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        </footer>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"panel right\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-form\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"contact-form\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Make contact / Book a space</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Keep it brief — we'll reply within 48 hours. If this is urgent, please call.</p>\\n\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"(optional)\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I am contacting about</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"event\\\">Upcoming public event</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"private\\\">Private session / 1:1</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"couple\\\">Couples session</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"corporate\\\">Corporate or venue booking</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"press\\\">Press / collaboration</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"date\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"guests\\\"># of guests</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"guests\\\" name=\\\"guests\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"1 or 12\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about accessibility needs, intention, or questions about instruments (e.g., crystal bowls, tuning forks, monochord, gentle chimes).\\\" ></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"hint\\\">We respect your privacy — we will only use this to follow up.</div>\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(230,238,246,0.65)\\\">\\n            By contacting you agree to our terms and to receive transactional messages. For medical concerns, consult your provider first. If you'd like guidance choosing between public and private offerings, tell us in the message.\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Quick notes</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\"></div><div><strong>Sense-led</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">We design sound around breath and felt experience, not performance.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\"></div><div><strong>Premium care</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Small groups, considered acoustics, and intentional time for integration.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\"></div><div><strong>Flexible offerings</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">From 1:1 healing to corporate soundscapes — we tailor the container.</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- mini myth vs truth + case notes + faq + CTA condensed for contact page -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start;\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <strong>Myth vs Truth</strong>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Myth: Sound baths are loud concerts. <br/>Truth: They are carefully modulated experiences — immersive but held, meant to invite gentle nervous system regulation.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <strong>Case notes (how we hold a private)</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">We begin with intake (what you want to shift), set a timeframe, select a palette of instruments (e.g., crystal bowls + long-form gong + subtle tuning forks), and co-create safety signals. Sessions close with grounding and post-care suggestions.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions? Ask via form or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">Book a spot</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));color:#042;text-decoration:none\\\">Pricing & packs</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page for the sound bath site (layoutFamily=split_diagonal, voice=minimal_poetic).\\n\\nWhat this file is\\n\\n- contact.html: A standalone contact and booking page with an embedded SVG pattern (no external assets). It includes a poetic, sensory-forward hero, an information panel covering \\\"what to bring\\\", contraindications, session flow, and a booking/contact form. It also includes condensed versions of myth_vs_truth, pillars, and case_notes to satisfy the required section pack for this chunk.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace\\n\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — your studio or brand name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — short descriptive line\\n- {{PHONE}} — public contact phone\\n- {{EMAIL}} — contact email\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — label for the form submit button (e.g., \\\"Send request\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — form action target (endpoint or third-party form handler)\\n- {{CITY}} / {{STATE}} — location for clarity\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} — primary facilitator\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}} — typical event venue name\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} — next public event date\\n\\nNotes & implementation details\\n\\n- Visuals: The page uses CSS gradients, a diagonal split, and an embedded SVG pattern (inside the HTML) to achieve visual richness without external files.\\n- Accessibility: form fields have labels. The decorative SVG is aria-hidden and pointer-events are disabled so it does not interfere with interaction.\\n- Sound bath specifics: The page includes sensory and premium language, a detailed \\\"what to bring\\\" block, contraindications guidance, and a step-by-step session flow. The instrument palette mentioned in the form placeholder text is deliberately varied (crystal bowls, tuning forks, monochord, gentle chimes) to follow the uniqueness requirement.\\n- Navigation: Links are internal and intentionally use varied labels to avoid repetition across templates (Gather, Series, 1:1, Why we hold, Connect).\\n\\nHow to use\\n\\n- Replace placeholders with your real content. If you need server-side handling for the form, set {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} to your endpoint and implement form processing there.\\n- The embedded SVG pattern is intentionally subtle; adjust opacity in the .pattern-wrap rule if you want it stronger or weaker.\\n\\nDeveloper tips\\n\\n- To add an external assets/img/pattern.svg later, replace the inlined SVG block with an <img> or background-image reference and update the CSS.\\n- For theme tweaks: adjust --accent and --accent-2 in the :root to change the tonal palette.\\n- For mobile spacing: reduce --maxw or adjust padding in .wrap.\\n\\nLicense\\n\\nThis file is provided as-is for use in your project. Customize freely.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
